---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — Where Is Baldo?" description="Privacy Policy for whereisbaldo.com">
  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Effective Date: May 2026 · whereisbaldo.com</p>
  </div>
  <div class="post-body legal-body">

    <h2>The Short Version</h2>
    <p>I'm not selling your information. I don't care about your name or email for anything except responding to you. I use basic analytics to understand which posts people actually read. That's it.</p>

    <h2>What Data Do We Collect?</h2>
    <p><strong>If you email or contact me:</strong> I get your name and email so I can actually respond to you. I keep it. I don't sell it. I don't pass it to anyone.</p>
    <p><strong>If you just visit:</strong> Google Analytics tracks which pages you look at, how long you stay, and general stuff about your browser. It's anonymous — they don't know who you are, just that someone from somewhere read a post about Albania.</p>
    <p><strong>Cookies:</strong> Yeah, we use cookies. Check the <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> if you want the full breakdown.</p>

    <h2>Google Analytics (How I Know Anyone's Reading This)</h2>
    <p>I use Google Analytics to see which posts people actually care about. It tells me "someone from New York spent 5 minutes reading the Albania post" — but not who that person is. I don't know your name. I don't know your email. I just know the post was interesting enough to hold your attention.</p>
    <p>If you don't want to be tracked, you can install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

    <h2>Google AdSense (The Ads You See)</h2>
    <p>Google shows you ads based on what you've looked at before. They're not spying on you personally — they're just pattern-matching. If you don't like it, you can change your <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>.</p>

    <h2>Affiliate Links</h2>
    <p>This blog contains affiliate links. If you click a link and make a purchase, I may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. See our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">Affiliate Disclosure</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>Spam Protection on the Contact Forms</h2>
    <p>The contact forms are protected by Cloudflare Turnstile, which checks that you are a person and not a bot. It runs invisibly &mdash; there is nothing for you to click. Cloudflare may collect information about your browser and connection to make that check. See Cloudflare's <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/application-services/terms/turnstile-privacy-addendum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Turnstile Privacy Addendum</a> and their <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>. This data is used only to tell people from bots, not to profile or advertise to you.</p>

    <h2>Links to Other Sites</h2>
    <p>I link to a lot of places. Instagram, booking sites, random blogs. Once you click away from here, I can't guarantee what happens. Read their privacy policies if you're paranoid. I'm not responsible for what they do with your data.</p>

    <h2>Kids Under 13</h2>
    <p>This blog isn't for kids. If you're under 13 and reading about Albania and Scotland, cool, but I'm not collecting your information.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you might be able to ask me for any data I have about you, correct it, or delete it. Email <strong><a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></strong> and ask. I'll help.</p>

    <h2>If This Changes</h2>
    <p>I might update this policy if something changes. The date at the top will tell you when that happened. If you keep reading, you're cool with the new version.</p>

    <h2>Questions?</h2>
    <p>I'm not a lawyer. But I'm also not trying to trick you. Email me: <strong><a href="mailto:baldolanded@gmail.com">baldolanded@gmail.com</a></strong></p>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-body h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
</style>
